2. GOVERNMENT SOURCE MATERIAL — the part that matters most
================================================================================

This project ingests documents published by the Government of Nepal, including
but not limited to:

  * Public Service Commission of Nepal (psc.gov.np)
  * The seven Provincial Public Service Commissions (Koshi, Madhesh, Bagmati,
    Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali, Sudurpaschim)
  * Nepal Agricultural Research Council (narc.gov.np)
  * The ministry responsible for agriculture policy and its agencies
  * The Nepal Gazette

THE AGRILOK PROJECT CLAIMS NO COPYRIGHT IN THOSE DOCUMENTS. Under the Copyright
Act, 2059 (2002) of Nepal, copyright in works published by the Government of
Nepal is held by the Government of Nepal. Nothing in LICENSE or LICENSE-CONTENT
grants you any right in that material, and downstream users of this project
receive no such right from us.

This project relies on the fair-dealing provisions of the Copyright Act, 2059,
which permit use for private study, research, teaching and citation where such
use does not harm the economic interests of the rights holder. To stay inside
that boundary, the project binds itself to the following rules. They are
enforced in review, not merely aspirational:

  (a) Summarize and cite. Do not republish a government document in full as
      the product. Quotation is limited to what is needed to answer a specific
      study question.
  (b) Always link back. Every derived answer, summary or question must carry a
      resolvable link to the original document on its official domain, plus the
      date it was fetched.
  (c) Never imply endorsement. This project is independent and unaffiliated.
  (d) Never alter meaning. Translations, summaries and reformattings must be
      faithful; where a summary and the source disagree, the source wins and
      the summary is a bug.
  (e) Honour the publisher's wishes. robots.txt and terms of service are
      re-checked before a source is added and on an ongoing basis. A takedown
      or objection from a source operator is honoured immediately and without
      argument. See docs/crawl-policy.md.
  (f) Do not redistribute the raw corpus. Fetched originals live in data/raw/,
      which is gitignored and is not published as a dataset.

If you represent a rights holder and believe this project has overstepped,
please contact ganeshchaudhary4400@gmail.com or open a GitHub issue. Requests
are honoured first and discussed afterwards.

